# Wise Defense SaaS

## Current Infrastructure

### VPS Stack

- Docker
- Traefik
- Node.js API
- Dashboard
- PostgreSQL 16
- Redis 7
- Worker Service
- Discord Bot
- Ollama / Hermes3

## Current Status

Production stack deployed and operational.

Services:

- API
- Dashboard
- Database
- Redis
- Worker
- Discord Control

## Deployment

Update:

```bash
cd ~/wise-defense-saas
git pull
docker compose up -d --build
```

## Environment

POSTGRES_DB=wisedefense

REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379

